<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-ROMANIA BEAT BELGIUM IN DAVIS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ROMANIA BEAT BELGIUM IN DAVIS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania beat Belgium 3-2 in their Davis Cup tennis World Group qualifier after winning both reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Romania names first):</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 6-0 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel (Romania) beat Johan van Herk (Belgium) 6-3 6-4 6-3.</p>
